| `layers.frontend.journey.host` | string | `127.0.0.1` | a non-empty loopback host name or address, an IPv6 one without brackets (`::1`) | `src/frontend/<stack>/playwright.config.ts` (`make test-fe-e2e`) | Changes the host the browser journey's preview server binds and the browser opens, which brackets an IPv6 address in its URL; an empty or non-string value, or one no URL can hold (`[::1]` included), fails the journey as its config loads, naming the key. | the dev server (`make run-web`) or the REST API (`make run-api`), which do not read it | when `frontend_stack` is not `none` |
